# Key material and device artifacts. These must never enter the repository: a wrap blob, a DKEK
# share, a private key or a board dump is the user's credential, not a build product.
*.wrap
*.pbe
*.dkek
*.pem
*.key
*.der
*.crt
*.p12
*.pfx
hw-test.bin
roundtrip.bin
__pycache__/
*.pyc
